CELL 4 7 pipe SN 3 E 1 0.00
CELL 4 8 pipe SN 3 E 1 0.00
CELL 4 9 drop N 3 S 1 100.00
BUCKET 297.00 716.00 150.00 90.00
ON 2
LABEL 24.00 90.00 HYDRAULIC MOTOR\nV1 runs HM1, which drives Conveyor01;\nFC1 (mouse wheel) sets its speed.\nAC1 stores oil pressure.
